<title>USA: Albertson's Dec same-store sales up 1.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Albertson's Dec same-store sales up 1.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albertson's Inc reported Monday that same-store sales rose 1.9 percent for the four-week period ended January 2. Total sales for the period rose 10.1 percent.</p>
<p>The company did not provide dollar figures.</p>
<p>For the nine-week period ended January 2, same-store sales rose 1.8 percent, it said.</p>
